<title>USA: First Team taps Kilter as agency of record.</title>
<headline>First Team taps Kilter as agency of record.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Team Sports Inc said Thursday it had retained Minneapolis-based Kilter Inc to assist it with its advertising programs. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Kilter will be responsible for development of the 1998 international print campaign for First Team's UltraWheels in-line skates.</p>
<p>First Team's agency for the last two years was TDA in Longmont, Colo.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
